---
title: P360 archive contract-boundary sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Use case caller
    participant Factory as P360_AdapterFactory
    participant Orchestrator as AAREG_ArchiveApplicationOrchestrator
    participant Adapter as P360_IArchiveAdapter
    participant Client as P360_IRpcClient
    participant Boundary as Unresolved SIF RPC boundary

    Caller->>Factory: Compose standard adapter
    Factory-->>Caller: Return injected adapter
    Caller->>Orchestrator: archive(command)
    alt command is null or applicationId is missing
        Orchestrator-->>Caller: P360_ContractException
    else command is structurally valid
        Note over Orchestrator,Adapter: Current implementation stops at explicit contract boundary
        Orchestrator-->>Caller: P360_ContractException (not implemented)
        Note over Adapter,Client: No adapter or RPC call is made by the current orchestrator stub
    end

    Note over Client,Boundary: Endpoint, authentication, payload and response mapping await confirmed SIF contract
